{
  "_comment": [
    "Report 957 — 'SAMPLE REJECTION STATUS' (LAB).",
    "Captured from the portal's own GetReportData request, unchanged apart from",
    "the two dates and loginUserId, which the server fills in per request.",
    "Joined by LIS_SAMPLE_NO: why a sample was turned away and who collected it.",
    "Its Hospital filter is mandatory and has no '%' option, so this one is",
    "fetched once per hospital and the answers are put together — see fan_out.",
    "It has a row per rejected test, so the per-test columns are skipped and",
    "only what is true of the whole sample is joined on.",
    "Re-capture it the same way if the HIS ever changes the report's filters."
